{"body":"Pull request for Issue [#7033](https://github.com/microsoft/DirectXShaderCompiler/issues/7033). It is still lacking a test though. If you can give me a quick pointer to a test directory where I can reformulate my reproducer as a test, I will add it as well.","closedAt":"2025-11-05T13:15:40Z","comments":[{"id":"IC_kwDOBIRuvs6eUJwv","author":{"login":"ChristianReinbold"},"authorAssociation":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"I am not building with ninja right now, but have a visual studio solution. Right now I am trying to launch tests via:\r\n\r\n`hcttest file-check \"src\\tools\\clang\\test\\CodeGenSPIRV\\attribute.location.lib.hlsl\"`\r\n\r\nbut it fails at the disassembly stage due to an invalid bitcode signature. Note that the compilation process seems to succeed. Whatever I am trying to do in order to make tests work, I seem to be completely on the wrong track here. That blocks me right now. No idea where to continue the investigation.","createdAt":"2025-02-13T10:00:00Z","includesCreatedEdit":true,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/microsoft/DirectXShaderCompiler/pull/7139#issuecomment-2656082991","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOBIRuvs6gZpHA","author":{"login":"s-perron"},"authorAssociation":"COLLABORATOR","body":"Sorry, I did not get back to you. Can run the tests by building the `check-clang-codegenspirv` target. Look for that target in visual studio.","createdAt":"2025-02-28T16:32:07Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/microsoft/DirectXShaderCompiler/pull/7139#issuecomment-2691076544","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOBIRuvs7PUDJb","author":{"login":"ChristianReinbold"},"authorAssociation":"CONTRIBUTOR","body":"> Sorry, I did not get back to you.\r\n\r\nI am sorry for keeping you waiting so long. I had a large shift of priorities in work and then I forgot about this MR. I added the reproducer from the issue as a test and checked that it fails without the proposed change.\r\n\r\nI do not remember what I tried with `hcttest` back then. Building with plain cmake/ninja and running the target as proposed worked like a charm now. Thanks for your hint!","createdAt":"2025-11-02T17:44:57Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/microsoft/DirectXShaderCompiler/pull/7139#issuecomment-3478139483","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOBIRuvs7QD59X","author":{"login":"s-perron"},"authorAssociation":"COLLABORATOR","body":"/AzurePiplines run","createdAt":"2025-11-05T11:30:45Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/microsoft/DirectXShaderCompiler/pull/7139#issuecomment-3490684759","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOBIRuvs7QD7ev","author":{"login":"s-perron"},"authorAssociation":"COLLABORATOR","body":"/AzurePipelines run","createdAt":"2025-11-05T11:32:19Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/microsoft/DirectXShaderCompiler/pull/7139#issuecomment-3490690991","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOBIRuvs7QD7o6","author":{"login":"azure-pipelines"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"<samp>\nAzure Pipelines successfully started running 1 pipeline(s).<br>\r\n\n</samp>","createdAt":"2025-11-05T11:32:31Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/microsoft/DirectXShaderCompiler/pull/7139#issuecomment-3490691642","viewerDidAuthor":false}],"commits":[{"authoredDate":"2025-02-12T08:00:55Z","authors":[{"email":"32750401+ChristianReinbold@users.noreply.github.com","id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMyNzUwNDAx","login":"ChristianReinbold","name":"ChristianReinbold"}],"committedDate":"2025-11-02T17:07:25Z","messageBody":"","messageHeadline":"lower spirv ray query type to opaque debug type","oid":"64982b457a31dca2620474ea6da2851